      "message": "test(tools): library holder tests follow the holder key\n\nThe tool library tests dropped or corrupted `body` on a tool whose\nlibrary holder is now written as `holder`; they clear both keys, and\nthe malformed-outline case uses the meshed tool. One decision line on\nthe import's same-tool test.\n\nRefs #2016\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
